  </div>

  <p>This diversity reflects the iOS community's willingness to explore different architectural patterns. While the web converges toward fine-grained signals and Android relies heavily on Google's standard stack, iOS developers have multiple mature options spanning store-centric, atomic, graph-based, and hybrid approaches.</p>
</DocsLayout>
